<title>USA: Standish Care changes name, symbol.</title>
<headline>Standish Care changes name, symbol.</headline>
<dateline>NEEDHAM, Mass. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standish Care Co said Thursday it changed its name to &quot;CareMatrix Corp&quot; and Nasdaq ticker symbol to &quot;STAND&quot;.</p>
<p>The changes, made to reflect a recent completed merger and one-for-five reverse split of Standish common stock, were effective from October 15 1996.</p>
